@baseUrl = http://[::1]:8080
@stagingChannel = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### staging 게스트는 403 (새 세션 발급 없음)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session?channelId={{stagingChannel}}
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Idempotency-Key: staging-guest-test

### local-member는 허용. DEMO 티켓 재시도에는 동일 키 사용
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session?channelId={{stagingChannel}}
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Idempotency-Key: staging-member-test
Cookie: PlatformSystemCode_O=DEMO; PlatformAuthentication_O=demo-ticket; PlatformVerify_O=demo-proof
